_paragraph\">Grind your viewership, preserve your mental health, and don\u2019t forget to eat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mental health doesn\u2019t magically replenish itself from stream to stream, so think long term, and keep it above zero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stream toxicity can drive easy traffic, but you\u2019ll need to contain it if you want to build a loyal audience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>WARNING: This game was designed to be as real as possible and is likely to crush your hopes and dreams. If you find it fun, you might want to seek help.</u></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Deckbuilder in a Visual Novel form. Embark on an epically misguided quest to streamer stardom! Play games all day, keep your mental health above zero, and prove your father wrong by grinding your way up to a minimum wage... also pay rent. Mental breakdown guaranteed!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cI CAN'T BELIEVE A GAME TITLED &quot;WATCH ME STREAM MY MENTAL BREAKDOWN&quot; WAS DIFFICULT, I THOUGHT MENTAL BREAKDOWNS ARE EASY, I HAVE THEM ALL THE TIME,\u201d<br>Freya Fukunaga<br><br>\u201cToo Darn Realistic\u201d<br>TechRaptor<br><br>\u201cI'm not usually a fan of a card battle, but the way this one integrates real life vs. job life vs. dreams is really interesting, and I really want to play more.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
